      "text": "VT-28 RANGERS\nCDR James P. Morrison, USN CDR Zachary S. Smith, USN\nNAS CORPUS CHRISTI, TEXAS\nCommanding Officer Executive Officer\nSaturday, 14-Nov-2026\nSUNRISE: 06:50 MOONRISE: 11:27 JULIAN DATE: 6318\nSUNSET: 17:37 MOONSET: 22:00 % ILLUM: 21%\nQUESTIONS OF THE DAY\nDUTY/WATCH ASSIGNED START END\nODO (AM) Casey S, LT 0700 1500\nDUTY DRIVER (AM) Gilbert L, 2ndLt 0630 1530\nDUTY DRIVER (PM) Glasgow G, 2ndLt 1530 2359\nAODO(AM)-WEEKEND Asjes P, ENS 0630 1530\nAODO(PM)-WEEKEND Coleman A, ENS 1530 2300\n1. Students not on hold notify ODO if not scheduled on 3 consecutive working days.\n2. Students on standby shall physically muster with ODO with brief products ready at the start of standby window.\n3. Notify ODO after completing FMS lab (SY0302) so ODO can mark it as a pass in TSHARP.\n4. ***Admin Upchit Time at Clinic: 0800-0900 Mon-Fri.***\nResources\nSuicide Prevention: Dial 988 or visit veteranscrisisline.net\nFleet and Family Support NASCC Information and Referral: 361-961-2372\nSexual Assault Response: 1-877-995-5247 or visit www.safehelpline.org\n24/7 SAPR VA Corpus Christi Duty Phone: 361-438-7778\nChaplain Eubanks\u2019 Duty Cell: 361-254-0515\nVT-28 Ombudsman: Mrs. Kristen Lindinger Cell: 717-497-5474\nCorpus Christi Vet Center, Emotional Support Animals Phone: 361-854-9961\nWing CDO Duty Cell: 361-533-4714. Check FITU Schedule for name.\nSAPR VA: LT Garcia | CMEO: LT Roeschen | Suicide Prevention Officer: LT Street\nOPERATIONS OFFICER COMMANDING OFFICER\nMaj C. M. LINDINGER CDR J. P. MORRISON"
